        "--prompt-en",
        "A new fashion editorial photograph follows The human subject through the last beat of a commute, at a city rail platform where the final train slides past and an amber stairwell opens toward evening. The supplied portrait guides the subject’s visible face and hair: a softly oval face, dark brown eyes, and a jaw-length dark brown bob with airy, separated fringe. The human subject chooses the stair route, turning three-quarter toward its warm light. One hand lightly gathers the lapel of a clean-lined, short deep-navy wool coat that ends below the hips, leaving the lower thighs clear; a separate cream high-neck sweater shows beneath it, and charcoal tailored trousers stand apart in tone from the coat. Fingers press a small fold at the lapel while the other arm rests naturally. The departing train leaves a brief red reflection across the glass, while the stairwell glow marks the next way out. Cool blue platform light and amber stair light come from distinct directions; their colored footprints follow the coat’s folds and nearby occlusion. The coat’s fine nap and the sweater’s knit retain irregular detail, broad tonal transitions remain distinct from texture, and adjacent edges stay coherent. Frame a full-length vertical portrait with the face, hand-to-lapel contact, coat hem, and both planted shoes visible. The expression is composed but softening, with restrained ease in the eyes and shoulders; the image feels like a private pause within a considered fashion portrait.",
